config SUNXI_DUAL_STORAGE
	bool "Support sunxi dual storage"
	depends on OF_LIBFDT
	default n
	help
	  Enable support for sunxi dual storage (e.g. SPI-Nor + eMMC,
	  this option enables booting BOOT0/U-Boot from SPI-Nor flash, and loading kernel/rootfs from eMMC.)
	  you also have to set two properties (boot_storage_type and system_storage_type) int U-boot dts.